<div class="locnote">
<b>Home 2+ years old</b>: reduced VAT of <b>10%</b> (and <b>5.5%</b> on energy-efficiency work — insulation, efficient heating…). <b>New / under 2 years / business premises</b>: everything at <b>20%</b>. Materials you buy yourself (“DIY”) stay at <b>20%</b> in every case.</div>
<div class="gl">Budget &amp; contingency</div>
<div class="depart">
<div class="fld">
<label for="av-reno-budget">Max budget <span style="color:var(--faint)">· optional</span>
</label>
<span class="av-step field">
<input id="av-reno-budget" type="number" inputMode="decimal" min="0" step="1000" value="150000"/>
<span class="u">€</span>
<span class="st">
<button type="button" aria-label="Decrease">−</button>
<button type="button" aria-label="Increase">+</button>
</span>
